QuestGuidance.Register("en",279,{
[8897]="7005BF69\n1\tDefeat snow-beasts (total: 12)\030Destroy slop barrels (total: 10)\tYou should defeat snow-beasts and destroy slop barrels within the cavern.\n2\tRegroup near the entrance to the cave\tYou should regroup near the entrance to the cave.\n",
[8898]="7005BF6A\n1\tComplete Mission: Storm Swept\tYour mission is to drive off the snow-beasts and destroy their food sources through the cavern. Speak to Hórin to travel to the cavern where the snow-beasts have been driven.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8899]="7006EB38\n1\tComplete Mission: Succulent Soldiers\tYour mission is to cause a disturbance in a cave that is known for its spiders, but is now being occupied by Ekhamâti soldiers. Extinguish the soldiers' fires and sound their alarms to bring the spiders down on them. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to cause a disturbance in a cave that is known for its spiders, but is now being occupied by Ekhamâti soldiers. Extinguish the soldiers' fires and sound their alarms to bring the spiders down on them.\n",
[8900]="70059562\n1\tComplete Mission: Svalfang's Stand\tYour mission is to defeat the hill giant, Svalfang, in the Wildwood. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[8901]="70059563\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn at the east side of the hill to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tFind Svalfang\tYou should find Svalfang. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tDefeat Svalfang\tYou should defeat Svalfang. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8902]="70062FBC\n1\tDefeat the turtle-matron\030Defeat dread-turtle young (total: 15)\t\n2\tFind and speak with a Scout\t\n",
[8903]="7006302E\n1\tComplete the Mission: Terrible Turtle Trouble\tA rather large turtle is threatening the hobbit-folk fishing and dredging in the nearby swamp-land. Speak to the mission giver to help them out with this problem.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tHaving dispatched the turtle and her brood, you should now return to the mission giver and let them know of your deeds.\n",
[8904]="70062D00\n1\tComplete the Mission: Tharbad Tower Ascent\tSpeak with the mission giver and let them know that you are ready to investigate the tower.\n2\tReturn to Hithriel and tell them of the commander's defeat\tWith the defeat of the Orc commander of Tharbad, you should return to the mission giver.\n",
[8905]="70062D01\n1\tDefeat the Orc commander of Tharbad Tower\tDefeat the Orkish commander of Tharbad Tower\n2\tApproach the scout to return to camp\tApproach the scout to return to camp.\n",
[8906]="70062B47\n1\tClear the tower courtyard of defenders\tClear the tower courtyard of defenders.\n2\tApproach the scout to return to camp\tApproach the scout to return to camp.\n",
[8907]="70062B4A\n1\tComplete the Mission: Tharbad Tower Courtyard\tSpeak with the mission giver and let them know that you are ready to investigate the tower.\n2\tThe tower courtyard has been cleared of foes. Speak with the mission giver in order to continue your assault.\t\n",
[8908]="70062D48\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Accursed Flame\tSpeak with the mission giver and let them know you are ready to complete your mission in the Greyflood.\n2\tTell Hithriel that the flame has been extinguished\tWith the flame extinguished, you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your findings.\n",
[8909]="70062D49\n1\tDouse the accursed flame\tApproach the accursed flame and extinguish it to banish the spirits.\n2\tApproach the scout to return to camp\tApproach the scout to return to camp.\n",
[8910]="700581A6\n1\tTalk to Ausma\tGorgar has been spotted at the Goblin-gate! Report to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu at once!\n2\tComplete Mission: The Assassination of Gorgar\tYour mission is to find and defeat Gorgar the Ruthless in Goblin-town. Speak to Ausma to travel to Goblin-town.\n3\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete, though not quite a success. You should talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu.\n4\tTalk to Glóin\tThe mission is complete, though not quite a success. You should talk to Glóin in Annâk-khurfu.\n",
[8911]="700581AD\n1\tPick up the Summoning Horn\tUse the summoning horn at the cave entrance to summon Hórin and Ausma to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Dwarves skill and talk to Ausma\tYou have arrived in Goblin-town with Hórin and Ausma. You should talk to Ausma. If you become separated, the summoning horn at the cave entrance to summon Hórin and Ausma to your side.\n3\tFind Gorgar\tFind Gorgar the Ruthless somewhere in Goblin-town. If Ausma or Hórin are missing, and the Call Dwarves skill is not available, try using the /pet release command twice.\n4\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have found Gorgar speaking with the new Great Goblin. You should talk to Ausma. If Ausma or Hórin are missing, and the Call Dwarves skill is not available, try using the /pet release command twice.\n5\tOpen the gate\tUse Ausma's lockpicks to open the gate lock.\n6\tDefeat Gorgar the Ruthless\tThe gate has been opened! You should defeat Gorgar the Ruthless!\n7\tTalk to Ausma\tThe Great Goblin has been defeated, but Gorgar escaped with his life. You should talk to Ausma. If you become separated, the summoning horn at the cave entrance to summon Hórin and Ausma to your side.\n",
[8912]="70066B57\n1\tDefeat the beast: Modrank\tConfront and defeat the beast.\n2\tReturn to the entrance of the cave\tThe beast falls to your mighty attacks, but the haversack mentioned by the mariner is nowhere to be found. There is a commotion near the entrance.\n",
[8913]="7006907F\n1\tComplete Mission: The Beast of Belfalas\tYour mission is to find the legendary Beast of Belfalas and subdue or defeat it. Speak to Malthak to travel.\n2\tTalk to Malthak\tYou have successfully defeated the great beast Tarasâd! Return with the Umbari scout to the mission giver with this report.\n",
[8914]="70057F0F\n1\tFind and defeat Frálnath\tFind and defeat Frálnath.\n2\tDefeat Bergelmir\tDefeat Bergelmir.\n",
[8915]="70057F4D\n1\tComplete Mission: The Beast of Misthallow\tYour mission is to find and defeat the great hunting cat which terrorizes Misthallow. Speak to Hórin to travel to Misthallow.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8916]="7006EC35\n1\tComplete Mission: The Blood Spectre\tYour mission is to infiltrate the Ekhamâti camp, steal their torches, spill hog's blood, and eliminate their dôla all to spread the fear of the Blood Spectre. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to infiltrate the Ekhamâti camp, steal their torches, spill hog's blood, and eliminate their dôla all to spread the fear of the Blood Spectre.\n",
[8917]="700585A6\n1\tDestroy the ritual obelisks (total: 2)\tDestroy the ritual obelisks.\n",
