[8921]="70057F16\n1\tFind Glymlauf\tFind Glymlauf.\n2\tDefeat Taurog corruptors (total: 4)\tDefeat the Taurog corruptors.\n3\tDefeat Glymlauf\tDefeat Glymlauf.\n",
[8922]="70057F53\n1\tComplete Mission: The Branches of Corruption\tYour mission is to defeat the source of the Taurogrim corruption. Speak to Ausma to travel to Óinsbridge.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8923]="70062BEC\n1\tReach the opposite side of the Bridge to Caranost\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8924]="70062C76\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Bridge to Caranost\tSpeak with the mission giver and have them escort you to the Bridge of Caranost where you will attempt to drive the Orcs back into the ruin.\n2\tTalk to Baglan\tYour success at forging across the bridge affords the encampment at Sírlond a welcome respite. Return to the mission giver with this report.\n",
[8925]="70069080\n1\tComplete Mission: The Call of the Sea\tYour mission is to investigate the northern Shield Isles of Jeb Khâtel and figure out what is happening to disappearing ships and their crews. Speak to Malthak to travel.\n2\tTalk to Malthak\tYou have successfully defeated the sirens and escaped with your life! Return to the mission giver with this report.\n",
