[8928]="7006C137\n1\tComplete Mission: The Dead Keep Their Secrets\tYour mission is to search for any sign of the missing quartet of travellers near the crypts of Esh-kimâkhi. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have returned the Dead to rest. Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with your report.\n",
